=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Darcia} in {z:Lower Jeuno} at (H-7) (**Chamber of Commerce** and **Industry**) and choose the option "__I would like to apply!__" indicating your interest to receive the {@k} {k:Geomagnetron} Key Item and a list of locations to which it can be attuned.
* Travel to **one** of the locations and attune the device to the **Geomagnetic Fount** found there:
** {z:Gustav Tunnel}: Map 1, at the pond closest to the {z:Cape Teriggan} exit (G-10).
*** Really close to {p:Unity Warp} 128. Go south into Map 1, the pond will be south-west, seconds away.
** {z:Ranguemont Pass}: Southeastern corner, (J-10)
** {z:Yughott Grotto}: (J-7), in the pond
** {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}: (K-6), nearest to {z:Jugner Forest} {p:Proto-Waypoint}
** {z:Monastic Cavern}: (H-10) Map 1
** {z:The Eldieme Necropolis}: (J-10) Map 2. Fall from first floor (F-8)
** {z:Ordelle's Caves}: Hidden Apparatus Area (F-12)
** {z:Gusgen Mines}: Last map, NW corner (G-7) Map 3
** {z:Dangruf Wadi}: (E-11), after falling in the hole in the hidden tunnel
** {z:Korroloka Tunnel}: (G-9) Map 4, ({m:Jammer Leech} {p:NM} spot)
** {z:Palborough Mines}: (J-8) Map 2
** {z:Labyrinth of Onzozo}: (J-5), Off the map in the northeast (access from the south).
** {z:Maze of Shakhrami}: (K-9) Map 1
** {z:Garlaige Citadel}: (G-8) Map 2, behind banishing gate #1
** {z:Crawlers' Nest}: (F-7) Map 1
** {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins}: (G-7) Map 2
*** Enter from {z:East Sarutabaruta} (H-3)
** {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}: (G/H-7) Map 2, Beetles Burrow.
*** Enter from {z:East Sarutabaruta} (J-7)
** {z:Toraimarai Canal}: (I-6) towards {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}
* Return to {n:Darcia} with the attuned Geomagnetron to receive the {@k} {k:Adoulinian charter permit}.
* Alternatively, this mission can be skipped by paying 1,000,000 {p:Gil} to the NPC to immediately receive the {@k} {k:Adoulinian charter permit}.
** This mission can also be skipped by completing {p:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel} Mission {M:The River Runs Red|The River Runs Red|The River Runs Red}, {n:Iroha} will hand you the Geomagnetron for you to speak with Darcia to receive the {@k} {k:Adoulinian charter permit}.

=2 Suggestions For New Players
\**Note**: Low level players will need either {@i:Sneak (Scroll)|4745} {s:Sneak} and {@i:Invisible (Scroll)|4744} {s:Invisible} or a {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} and {@i:Prism Powder|4164} {i:Prism Powder|Prism Powder|4164} to easily avoid aggressive monsters along the way.
* If you wish to do this without sneak or invisible then pick the Windurst Path below.

 **Bastok**
* {z:Korroloka Tunnel} (G-9) Map 4

!Korroloka Tunnel-map1.jpg||Korroloka Tunnel map 1
!Korroloka Tunnel-map4.jpg||Korroloka Tunnel map 4
:* Enter {z:Zeruhn Mines} from {z:Bastok Mines} (D-7)

::* Run straight ahead and speak with {n:Lasthenes} to pass through the gate. Proceed ahead and zone into Korroloka.

:* Once in Korroloka, proceed ahead, Seeker Bats and Land Worms do __not__ aggro.

::* Take a left at the fork in the path at (K-8).
::* Take a right over the bridge at (G-9).
::* Take a left at (D-8) when the road forks then proceed over the Bridge at (C-9) and into the tunnel.

:* You will need sneak and invisble from this point onwards. The goblins, kraken, pugils ahead are aggressive.

::* Follow the path to the right, the room opens up at (I-8) where you will see a kraken, water, and stuff.

:::* You are almost there, head over the bridge and hug the left into the final misty room.

::::* **Careful**, the Jammer Leeches will aggro without {s:Sneak} active (even to level 99 players). The Fount is in the water on the right side of the room, (G-9).

 **San d'Oria**
* {z:Ranguemont Pass} (J-10)

!Ranguemont Pass-map.jpg||Ranguemont Pass map
:* Enter from {z:East Ronfaure} (G-4) and proceed ahead to the red glowing gate at (F-10).

::* The goblins and bats after you immediately enter are around level 4-8 and aggressive.

:* Speak to {n:Myffore} to pass through the gate.

::* Monsters on this side are aggressive once again and around level 25-30+

:* Apply sneak and invisible after stepping through the gate and hug the right wall the whole way there.

::* Proceed right at the fork in the road at (G-8)
::* Proceed right at the fork in the road at (I-9)
::* The fount is in the pond in the back left corner of (J-10)

 **Windurst**
* {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins} (G-7)

!Outer Horutoto Ruins-map2.jpg||Outer Horutoto Ruins map 2
:* Enter from the {z:East Sarutabaruta} (H-3) Tower.

::* The monsters you will encounter are only levels 1-4, but are aggressive nonetheless.
::* Proceed to the left, down the hall to (G-7), and the fount is behind the furthest southwest __Stone Door__.

